    "body": "These are multiple feature proposals to have a better compliance with [GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Data_Protection_Regulation). \r\n\r\n- [x] Right of Data Portability #3314\r\n- [x] Right to be Forgotten #3315 \r\n- [x] Unmark \"receive information\" by default on user creation  #3316\r\n- [x] Pages version control #3317\r\n- [x] TOS accepted at field for users #3318\r\n- [x] Unbundled consent on user registration #3319 , PR #3483\r\n- [x] Opt-in for all the users with newsletters  #3492",
